 "title": "Producers Cooperative Association | PCA Coop",
 "text": "-->\nProducers Cooperative Association | PCA Coop\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nContact Us\nForms\nWeather\nCareers\nNews\nHome\nAbout Us\nOur Company\nBoard of Directors\nLeadership\nLocations\nDivisions\nGrain\nFeed\nAgronomy\nEnergy\nFarm Stores\nCash Bids\nCash Bids\nFutures\nPCA Portal\nFormed in 1948, Producers Cooperative Association is a longstanding solution to all of your agricultural needs.\nAbout Us\nCash bids\nServices\nP C A employs a professional and highly knowledgeable team that is eager to help improve your operation. We continually invest in equipment, processes and talent to ensure a great customer experience at all of our locations.\nWe offer a full line of farm and ranch supplies, custom manufactured feeds and full-service agronomy centers. For additional convenience, PCA offers diverse grain merchandising options, including direct ship and on-farm pick up. Our energy department offers delivery of bulk fuels, oil, lubricants and propane to keep your operation running smoothly.\nClick on a department below to learn more!\nGrain\nFeed\nAgronomy\nEnergy\nFarm Stores\nVISIT US\nPhone\nLocation\n800-442-2809\n300 E Buffalo St\nGirard, KS 66743\nPO Box 323\nPrivacy & Terms of Service\n2025 PCA\nAll Rights Reserved\nFollow Us\nContact u s\nSubmit\nThanks for submitting!\nbottom of page",
